                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "One of the many benefits of sharing your data openly is impact and \nengagement. In this session Lotte Houtepen (Project & Policy officer\n on the “Evaluating societal impact” project) together with Rajarshi Chakraborty (ECDA) and Roel van den Berg (Erasmus \nInitiatives Business Manager) will tell us how opening your data \nincreases your connection to society."
